NOT RUN (the person who wrote the sheet)
  - ONE INSTANCE FOR THE DAY (the family's): the cap of 3 is a day cap and one position at a time holds for the whole day; the lane's random control and reads still go pass by pass. The lane's generic note 'entries 10:30-15:30' is the Conti family's window, not this one's (09:35-15:00).
  - THE VWAP: the family's rth VWAP, volume-weighted (h + l + c) / 3 of the 1-minute bars from 09:30 ET; the 30-minute slope is the VWAP now vs its value at the 1-minute close 30 minutes before.
  - ENTRY WINDOW: signal closes after 09:35 and at or before 15:00 (the family's `end` 15:00; its written taught window is 09:35-11:00, so the 15:00 end is the owner's screening setting, as in owner_vwap_pullback_25_38).
  - The family's 3-losses-in-a-row stop is off (max_loss 99), as the owner's VWAP sheets.
  - FAMILY'S UNSEEN MONTHS: the owner's 1-minute VWAP pullback sheets had their 3:1 walk-forwards read on 2026-10-20; the 15-minute entries are mostly different trades, but the idea's test months are not blind.
  - COSTS AND FILLS: the engine's own (1 tick of slippage on market and stop fills, $4 a round turn, tick replay).
  - FLAT: every trade is flat by 15:58 ET (13:13 on half days).
  - THE TEST DAYS (2025-07-01 on) ARE NOT READ by this sheet: build days only; the 3:1 block walk-forward comes later under PREREG.

ALSO TRUE OF THE RUN (the lane)
  - ONE INSTANCE FOR THE DAY (nyam, mid, pm are one window, entries 10:30-15:30, flat 15:58): the cap of 3 trades is a DAY cap, one position at a time holds for the whole day, and the family's loss stop counts over the day (max_loss). The random control and the reads still go pass by pass (nyam, mid, pm), matched by day.
  - Every trade is flat by 15:58 ET (13:13 on an equity half day); no entry in the last 5 minutes of a pass.
  - Costs: $4.00 a round turn and 1 tick of slippage on market and stop fills, 1 contract (the engine's own).

HONEST LIMITS
  - One video's rule, read on the build days (2021-09-22 .. 2025-06-30): in-sample.
  - The family's settings and the exits are the video's own: nothing was tuned, searched or picked.
  - The neighbours are shown to see how fragile the rule is; they are not alternatives to choose from.
